        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.118,
            0.573,
            0.15
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三、选择题(每小题2分，共26分):"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.157,
            0.639,
            0.188
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1.为什么透射电镜显微照片从来都没有彩色的？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.19,
            0.611,
            0.317
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.167,
                0.19,
                0.467,
                0.216
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "①因为细胞结构不是彩色的;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.166,
                0.222,
                0.611,
                0.252
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "②因为透射电镜用的彩色底片还没有发明;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.165,
                0.255,
                0.609,
                0.285
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "③因为样品被超薄切片并被重金属盐染色;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.164,
                0.287,
                0.606,
                0.317
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "④因为底片是对透过样品的透射电子感光."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.321,
            0.75,
            0.353
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2.下面哪种生物的细胞膜中不饱和脂肪酸的含量比例最高?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.354,
            0.755,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "①南极洲的鱼； ②仙人掌； ③热温泉中的细菌； ④人."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.387,
            0.506,
            0.413
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3.下面哪组蛋白可能缺少信号序列?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.418,
            0.884,
            0.485
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.156,
                0.418,
                0.884,
                0.455
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "①在巨噬细胞中合成的酸性水解酶； ②在肝细胞中合成的糖酵解酶；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.156,
                0.451,
                0.832,
                0.485
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "③在内分泌细胞中合成的多肽激素； ④在浆细胞中合成的抗体."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.484,
            0.628,
            0.513
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 当用秋水仙素处理细胞以后,会产生什么结果?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.516,
            0.877,
            0.582
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.151,
                0.516,
                0.877,
                0.553
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "①细胞形状发生改变; ②有丝分裂与减数分裂不会发生;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.151,
                0.548,
                0.803,
                0.582
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "③细胞器在胞内的位置将发生改变；④上述三种现象都会发生."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.582,
            0.52,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.下面哪种功能不是p53的正常功能?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.612,
            0.889,
            0.676
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 20,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.612,
                0.889,
                0.649
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "①活化细胞周期抑制蛋白的转录；②在 DNA 损伤修复过程中发挥作用；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 21,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.645,
                0.679,
                0.677
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "③启动受损细胞的凋亡； ④诱导细胞癌变."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.678,
            0.828,
            0.712
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6.为了获得较正常老鼠体积大得多的超级老鼠,下面哪种方法最可行:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.71,
            0.65,
            0.773
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 24,
              "bbox": [
                0.143,
                0.71,
                0.582,
                0.739
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "①延缓细胞衰老； ②抑制细胞凋亡；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 25,
              "bbox": [
                0.143,
                0.741,
                0.65,
                0.773
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "③抑制 p53 功能; ④使其大量产生生长素."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.775,
            0.889,
            0.811
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7.当放射性标记的甘露糖掺入细胞以后，最先出现放射性标记的细胞器是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.807,
            0.685,
            0.84
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "①细胞核； ②内质网； ③高尔基体； ④溶酶体。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.055,
            0.921,
            0.124,
            0.941
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第2页"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
