          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8.下面有关异染色质的叙述错误的是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.135,
            0.864,
            0.259
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.18,
                0.135,
                0.531,
                0.159
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "①异染色质在间期处于凝集状态；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.178,
                0.168,
                0.754,
                0.194
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "②雌性生物的一条 X 染色体常以异染色质的形式存在;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.2,
                0.862,
                0.229
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "③异染色质由高度重复碱基序列组成，不具有编码蛋白质的功能；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.234,
                0.623,
                0.258
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "④结构异染色质常位于着丝粒和端粒部位."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.267,
            0.548,
            0.29
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9.下面哪种细胞肌动蛋白含量最丰富:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.298,
            0.834,
            0.358
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.174,
                0.298,
                0.431,
                0.322
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "①脊椎动物骨骼肌细胞；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.534,
                0.303,
                0.788,
                0.326
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "②小肠消化道上皮细胞；"
                }
